        "id": 225540,
        "name": "GTGAlex",
        "username": "GTGAlex",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/gtgalex/{size}/1994_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-02-08T21:37:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The second printing is what's out in the market and has been since last summer! The expansion, Rising Tide, is still the first printing and does have errors. We have errata tiles we can send out free of charge as well, though we're out of stock of them until this summer.</p>\n<p>So basically, you should feel free to purchase it and if you somehow end up with the first printing, request the errata tiles and we'll get them to you as soon as they're back in stock.</p>",
